[00:14.02] <I tried being helpful>
[00:16.78] <That was my first mistake>
[00:31.34] <I gave advice, nice and clear>
[00:35.12] <Talk real slow so folks could hear>
[00:38.30] <They nodded once, said, "That's real smart,">
[00:41.97] <then did the opposite from the start>
[00:44.86] <I showed the way with a simple sign>
[00:48.32] <Left is left, right is fine>
[00:51.36] <They still asked twice, maybe three, then>
[00:55.20] <blamed the road instead of me>
[00:57.50] <You can't fix stupid. That's what I found>
[01:04.20] <No wrench or prayer gonna turn it around>
[01:10.70] <You can talk all day>
[01:13.94] <You can beg and plead>
[01:16.98] <But stupid don't listen>
[01:20.66] <Stupid leads>
[01:27.06] <They read one line, skip the rest>
[01:30.01] <Say, "I know better," fail the test>
[01:33.78] <Ask for help then argue back>
[01:36.88] <Drive straight off the common track>
[01:40.00] <I used to care, tried to explain>
[01:43.36] <Lost my voice, gained a pain>
[01:46.80] <Now I sip my drink and smile>
[01:49.82] <Let ‘em learn the hard way while>
[01:52.46] <You can't fix stupid>
[01:56.20] <Learned it late>
[01:59.06] <Can't save folks from their own mistakes>
[02:05.48] <You can draw it clear, spell it slow>
[02:12.08] <They still choose the wrong damn road>
[02:43.72] <Now I mind my chair and mind my cup>
[02:47.46] <Let the world mess itself up>
[02:50.80] <Peace came quick when I finally quit trying>
[02:54.60] <to repair what don’t wanna fit>
[02:57.08] <You can't fix stupid>
[03:00.64] <I let it be>
[03:03.56] <Life got lighter once I agreed>
[03:10.02] <I fix my shoes. I fix my door>
[03:16.52] <Stupid ain't my job no more>
[03:26.33] <Wisdom ain't knowing every, it's knowing when to stop>
[03:32.34] <trying>